&lt;h3 id="v125">
 v1.25
 &lt;a class="anchor" href="#v125">#&lt;/a>
&lt;/h3>
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>Moved container registry service from k8s.gcr.io to &lt;code>registry.k8s.io&lt;/code>&lt;/li>
&lt;li>Introduced KMS v2&lt;/li>
&lt;li>Kube-proxy images are now based on distroless images&lt;/li>
&lt;li>PodSecurityPolicy is Removed, Pod Security Admission graduates to Stable&lt;/li>
&lt;li>Ephemeral Containers Graduate to Stable&lt;/li>
&lt;li>Support for cgroups v2 Graduates to Stable&lt;/li>
&lt;li>Promoted endPort in Network Policy to Stable&lt;/li>
&lt;li>Promoted Local Ephemeral Storage Capacity Isolation to Stable&lt;/li>
&lt;li>Promoted core CSI Migration to Stable&lt;/li>
&lt;li>Promoted CSI Ephemeral Volume to Stable&lt;/li>
&lt;li>Promoted SeccompDefault to Beta&lt;/li>
&lt;li>Promoted CRD Validation Expression Language to Beta&lt;/li>
&lt;li>Promoted Server Side Unknown Field Validation to Beta&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
